{"seq":2,"slug":"energy-label-efficiency-class","title":"能效标签与能效等级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecodesign-repairability-right-to-repair/ecodesign-regulation/energy-label-efficiency-class","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"能效标签与能效等级\">能效标签与能效等级</h1><p>冰箱上那张彩色条状标签是欧盟生态设计体系里跑得最久、覆盖最广的一条落地路径。它值得单独研究，不是因为标签本身复杂，而是因为它完整演示了 ESPR 那套&quot;框架授权—产品组法案—数据库注册—市场监督&quot;的机制如何真正运转。看懂这条链，就能预判 ESPR 未来在别的产品组上会长成什么形状。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>能效标签的法律基础是<strong>能源标签框架法规</strong>，产品组的具体义务则由各自的授权法规规定——例如家用制冷器具对应 2019/2016、洗碗机对应 2019/2017、光源对应 2019/2015、电子显示器对应 2019/2013（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EU_energy_label\">维基百科，EU energy label</a>）。这与 ESPR 的机制完全同构：一部框架法规 + 一组产品组授权法案。</p>\n<p>标签的核心是<strong>能效等级</strong>，用 A 到 G 七个字母表示，A 最省。2021 年那次改革做了一件关键的事：把历史上的 A+、A++、A+++ 全部废除，回到纯 A–G 七级。改革的动机是等级通胀——当市场上大部分产品都拿到 A+++，&quot;最高等级&quot;就失去了区分度。改革的设计是让 A 级<strong>初期为空</strong>，B、C 级产品稀疏分布，把上方留出来给未来的技术进步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[产品组授权法规] --&gt; B[能效指标&lt;br/&gt;EEI / lm/W 等]&#10;  B --&gt; C{等级阈值判定}&#10;  C --&gt; D[A: 初期为空&lt;br/&gt;留给未来技术]&#10;  C --&gt; E[B-C: 少数领先产品]&#10;  C --&gt; F[D-G: 多数存量产品]&#10;  D --&gt; G[标签生成]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[EPREL 数据库注册]&#10;  H --&gt; I[销售点展示&lt;br/&gt;实物 + 线上]\">graph TD\n  A[产品组授权法规] --&gt; B[能效指标&lt;br/&gt;EEI / lm/W 等]\n  B --&gt; C{等级阈值判定}\n  C --&gt; D[A: 初期为空&lt;br/&gt;留给未来技术]\n  C --&gt; E[B-C: 少数领先产品]\n  C --&gt; F[D-G: 多数存量产品]\n  D --&gt; G[标签生成]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[EPREL 数据库注册]\n  H --&gt; I[销售点展示&lt;br/&gt;实物 + 线上]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产品组</th>\n<th>授权法规</th>\n<th>主要能效指标</th>\n<th>标签适用时点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>家用制冷器具</td>\n<td>2019/2016</td>\n<td>能效指数 EEI</td>\n<td>2021 年起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>洗碗机</td>\n<td>2019/2017</td>\n<td>EEI</td>\n<td>2021 年 3 月 1 日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>洗衣机</td>\n<td>2019/2023 迭代</td>\n<td>EEI（每 100 次洗涤）</td>\n<td>2021 年 3 月 1 日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光源</td>\n<td>2019/2015</td>\n<td>总市电效能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{TM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>2021 年 9 月 1 日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电子显示器</td>\n<td>2019/2013</td>\n<td>EEI</td>\n<td>2021 年起</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"等级阈值怎么定\">等级阈值怎么定</h2><h3 id=\"能效指数-eei\">能效指数 EEI</h3><p>多数产品组的判定量是<strong>能效指数</strong>（Energy Efficiency Index, EEI），定义为一个比值：产品实测能耗与&quot;参考能耗&quot;之比，再乘以 100。参考能耗由法规根据产品容量、功能等参数给出基准。EEI 越低越省电，所以等级阈值以 EEI 的上界划分——以洗碗机为例，A 级要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EEI \\le 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span>，G 级为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>62</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EEI &gt; 62</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">62</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EU_energy_label\">维基百科，EU energy label</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EEI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>实测能耗</mtext><mtext>参考能耗</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EEI} = \\frac{\\text{实测能耗}}{\\text{参考能耗}} \\times 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EEI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参考能耗</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实测能耗</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>洗衣机组的阈值口径略有不同：A 级对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>52</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EEI \\le 52</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">52</span></span></span></span></span>，G 级为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>102</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EEI &gt; 102</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">102</span></span></span></span></span>，且能耗按每 100 次洗涤计量。光源组换用另一套物理量——总市电效能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{TM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单位是流明每瓦（lm/W），A 级要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>210</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{TM} \\ge 210</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">210</span></span></span></span></span> lm/W，G 级为低于 85 lm/W。电子显示器组则用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A: EEI &lt; 0.30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G: EEI \\ge 0.90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.90</span></span></span></span></span> 的口径（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EU_energy_label\">维基百科，EU energy label</a>）。</p>\n<p>不同组用不同指标这件事本身是重要信息：<strong>不存在一个跨产品组通用的&quot;能效分&quot;</strong>。做跨品类合规系统时不能假设字段可复用，必须按组维护各自的指标定义与阈值表。这也是第四章第三篇矩阵必须按产品组拆行的原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"等级不能跨版本比较\">等级不能跨版本比较</h3><p>重新缩放带来一个后果需要向业务方明确传达：一台原本标注 A+++ 的冰箱在新标下可能变成 C，而它的实际能效没有任何变化。这意味着历史销售数据里的&quot;等级&quot;字段在不同时间点不可直接比较，做能效相关的 BI 分析时必须带上标注版本或标注日期，否则会得出&quot;产品变差了&quot;的错误结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注册与数据库\">注册与数据库</h2><p>产品要在欧盟市场销售能效标签覆盖的产品，相关方须在<strong>欧洲能源标签产品数据库</strong>（EPREL）注册产品并提供技术文档，之后才能取得并打印标签（<a href=\"https://energy-efficient-products.ec.europa.eu/product-list_en\">欧盟能效产品页面</a>）。这个注册动作是合规链条上一个硬性的技术关口：没有注册号，标签无法合法生成。</p>\n<p>对系统设计的启示是&quot;标签不是图片，而是注册记录的一个投影&quot;。渠道、客服、内容团队可能会把标签当成一个可下载的静态资源，但正确的心智模型是：EPREL 里的注册记录是真相源，标签图是它按模板渲染出的视图。产品停产、参数变更时，注册记录需要同步更新，否则会出现在售页面与实际注册不符的情况。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;eprel_registration&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;registration_number&quot;: &quot;0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;model_identifier&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;supplier_or_trademark&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;energy_class&quot;: &quot;C&quot;,&#10;    &quot;scale_version&quot;: &quot;2021-A-G&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;technical_documentation&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;eei_value&quot;: 0,&#10;    &quot;measured_per_cycle_kwh&quot;: 0,&#10;    &quot;test_standard&quot;: &quot;EN 60456&quot;,&#10;    &quot;lab&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;report_ref&quot;: &quot;&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;display&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;label_asset_ref&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;product_fiche_ref&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;online_display_required&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"eprel_registration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"registration_number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"model_identifier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"supplier_or_trademark\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"energy_class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"scale_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2021-A-G\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"technical_documentation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"eei_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"measured_per_cycle_kwh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test_standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EN 60456\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lab\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"report_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"display\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"label_asset_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"product_fiche_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"online_display_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份骨架的关键字段是 <code>scale_version</code> 与 <code>technical_documentation</code>。前者解决历史可比性问题，后者是市场监督抽查时的举证材料。注意 <code>test_standard</code> 与 <code>lab</code> 字段——标签数值不是厂商自报的自由数字，而是依据指定测试标准在实验室测出的结果，这个链条的完整性是合规抗辩的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线上展示与实体标签\">线上展示与实体标签</h2><p>能效标签的展示义务同时覆盖<strong>实体</strong>与<strong>线上</strong>。实体侧是随产品提供的标签与产品信息单；线上侧则要求在有价格的销售页面上以规定形式显示能效等级与标签。对电商系统来说，线上展示的技术难点不在渲染，而在于<strong>触发条件的判断</strong>：哪些页面算&quot;有价格的产品页面&quot;、变体页与聚合页分别如何展示、以及等级来自哪个数据源。</p>\n<p>一个常见的工程缺陷是标签数据与产品数据双写——内容团队在 CMS 里手工填等级，商品系统里有另一份，两者漂移导致超范围宣称或等级过时。正确做法是让 EPREL 注册记录成为等级的唯一真相源，展示层只做读取与渲染，任何人工填写都视为缺陷而非流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>能效标签是 ESPR 机制的成熟样本：框架法规 + 产品组授权法案 + 数据库注册 + 市场监督。</li>\n<li>2021 年改革废除 A+/A++/A+++，回到纯 A–G，A 级初期为空以留出技术空间。</li>\n<li>判定指标按产品组不同：EEI、lm/W 等，<strong>不存在跨品类通用能效分</strong>。</li>\n<li>等级不可跨标注版本直接比较，BI 与历史分析必须带版本信息。</li>\n<li>EPREL 注册是标签合法生成的前置条件，注册记录是等级的唯一真相源。</li>\n<li>展示义务覆盖实体与线上两侧，同一等级字段不得双写漂移。</li>\n<li>能效要求是<strong>性能要求</strong>；与之并列的信息要求形态见 <a href=\"espr-sustainable-product-requirement\">ESPR 生态设计可持续产品要求</a>，而直接约束物理属性的要求见 <a href=\"durability-recyclability-design-rule\">耐用性/可回收材料设计强制要求</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"能效标签与能效等级","id":"能效标签与能效等级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"等级阈值怎么定","id":"等级阈值怎么定"},{"level":3,"text":"能效指数 EEI","id":"能效指数-eei"},{"level":3,"text":"等级不能跨版本比较","id":"等级不能跨版本比较"},{"level":2,"text":"注册与数据库","id":"注册与数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"线上展示与实体标签","id":"线上展示与实体标签"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ESPR 生态设计可持续产品要求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecodesign-repairability-right-to-repair/ecodesign-regulation/espr-sustainable-product-requirement"},"next":{"title":"耐用性/可回收材料设计强制要求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ecodesign-repairability-right-to-repair/ecodesign-regulation/durability-recyclability-design-rule"}}